OL,5,G1100 Murder She Wrote
OL,6,     FJessica is kidnapped and is
OL,7,     Fbrought to the offices of a
OL,8,     Fprominent businessman and
OL,9,     Fphilanthropist, but is mistaken
OL,10,     Ffor a missing informant.
OL,11,G1200 Murder She Wrote
OL,12,     FJessica goes to Ireland to
OL,13,     Fresearch her latest book, and
OL,14,     Fstays in a house that is
OL,15,     Fsupposedly haunted by a weeping
OL,16,     Fspirit; the owner fears he is
OL,17,     Fgoing to die.
