OL,5,G1300 Murder She Wrote
OL,6,     FJessica Fletcher is outraged by
OL,7,     Fher depiction in a satirical comic
OL,8,     Fstrip as a blackmailing fox who
OL,9,     Fextorts money from policemen and
OL,10,     Fstockbrokers.
OL,11,G1400 Murder She Wrote
OL,12,     FJessica meets her equal in Sheriff
OL,13,     FSam Keeyani when the owner of the
